is not a Maven module and appears in no reactor - so it has no reactor entry here and
none is invented for it. Its expected non-JAR outcome belongs in run-record.md. The
same is true of resource-managers/kubernetes/docker, which the file-based tools scan
through the mid-path ** of the kubernetes glob.

