WHAT THIS FILE DELIBERATELY DID NOT DO
================================================================================

  - It did not build or scan the working checkout. That tree is one commit range
    ahead of the pin - 4.2.0-SNAPSHOT on Scala 2.13.18 with maven.version 3.9.12,
